        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Hmm...I can add a lot to this I think.  I might be editing this from time to time, depending on if I can find the links that I am after.</P><P>Armor-wise:  The stats are almost the same across the board, except for one major difference...the AC on the Kael armor is INSANE.  However, it is much more difficult to get in good standing with the giants for most people, so the reward is better.  Here is a great link that tells you all about the different Velious quest armor.</P><P><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/veliousarmour.html" target="_blank">http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/veliousarmour.html</a></P><P><BR>As to the faction that I would like to keep, I definitely want to side with the Dwarves and Dragons.  I am currently focusing on raising CoV faction, since I am already up to amiable with the short folks.  <img src=icon_smile_wink.gif border=0 align=middle></P><P></P><P>Senina<BR>aka LazyGirl, but at least now I can summon people!<BR><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
