        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> FYI the Skyshrine Warrior armor blows away the Kael and Thurgadin armor even in AC.</P><P>From what I have read, Storm Giants raise your CoV faction more than Frost Giants.  Forst Giants are better for Coldain faction. As far as I know, the only way to raise Yelinak faction is through quests. So you need to raise CoV faction to do quests in order to raise Yelinak faction.  Then you can go pet Wuoshi.</P><P>Norbert<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
