        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Oops.  Strike that.  The AC I had for the Kael armor was old.  Looks like they updated the armor.  It is better in AC by about 20 raw points.</P><P>That all really stinks since being a follower of Brell predetermined my faction to favor the Coldain.  Wouldn't you know they would have the crappiest armor.  Its still good armor, just not compared to the other quest armors.</P><P>Well, I'm still favoring the Coldain mostly and working on Dragons.</P><P>See ya.<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
