        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Well, just looking at the quest armor, I, being a melee class, would naturally prefer to ally with the giants, given the AC on that armor.   </P><P>That being said, I have already off-ed a fair number of giants. I am loved by the dwarves of Thurgadin, (though the Dain has his doubts still), and I am accepted in Skyshrine, and allowed to walk unhindered, at least through the lower halls.</P><P>So, for the time, I will continue to pursue dwarf/dragon faction. At some point in the distant future, I may want to try to change this (if possible), but for now, I will remain as I have been, dwarf and dragon aligned.</P><P>Chakar</P><P><BR> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
